# Wage Mutiny strings. Keys are relative to Mods.Levy.Mutiny (prefix comes from the file name).
Tag: "MUTINOUS {0}"
Begin: "MUTINY in {0}! {1} soldiers went unpaid and have turned on you. They refuse every order and are out to take {2} by force."
BeginHint: Pay the barracks treasury to end it. Until then they rob the townsfolk, attack you and raid your pockets and banks.
Shout: MUTINY! PAY US!
Refuse: "No orders! Not until we're paid!"
Refused: "{0} soldiers refuse your order. They are in mutiny until they are paid."
Cry1: Pay up or bleed!
Cry2: We're taking what we're owed!
Cry3: No coin, no orders!
Cry4: Your gold or your head!
Calm: Paid. Back to work.
CalmLoot: "{0} has taken the back pay and stands down."
PaidOff: "The treasury of {0} paid the back wages: {1}. The mutiny there is over."
Over: The mutiny is over. Every soldier is paid.
RobbedNpc: "Robbed {0}: {1}"
RobbedPlayer: "{0} robbed you of {1}."
RobbedBank: "{0} raided your pockets and your bank for {1}."
DeathReason: "{0} was cut down by {1}, who wanted his pay."
RobbedMood: Robbed by mutinous soldiers.
CardOwed: "MUTINY: owed {0}"
